WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.267
a number series!

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.933
Seven,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.633
fourteen,

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:12.300
twenty-one,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:12.967
twenty-eight,

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:14.300
and then...

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.300
what comes next?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:16.967
A.

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:17.633
Thirty-three,

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:18.333
B.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.000
Forty-two,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.667
C.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:20.333
Thirty-six,

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.667
or D.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.333
Thirty-five?

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:23.667
Five seconds!

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.133
The answer is...

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:33.733
D,

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.333
thirty-five!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.967
Each number goes up by seven:

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:38.567
seven,

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:39.167
fourteen,

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:39.767
twenty-one,

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:40.367
twenty-eight,

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:43.967
so twenty-eight plus seven is thirty-five.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:45.533
So,

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:47.567
are you smart or fart?

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:50.000
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.200
find your rank!

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:52.700
So,

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.100
how did you do?

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.467
Comment your score below,

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.833
and follow for more!
